{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">伯恩斯坦：Datadog与OpenAI降价-用量增长信号或不可靠</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">Datadog报价单日上涨超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>之后，市场在寻找一个解释。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>这份报告的切入点很直接：OpenAI在7月30日对GPT 5.6 Terra降价<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>、Luna降价<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">80%</span>，OpenRouter数据显示降价后几周内token消耗量比之前翻了约一倍。这个数字足够引人关注，让人联想到Datadog刚签下的OpenAI九位数合同可能在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>带来额外用量。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUlxZ0oEnWWDq44166lxhCKWPDESjiaCppicZpnC0BGEUtiaXwuKKEevRuAHyjHN1mXhKMFb60gpUv2pH2fZEcNE9AmYV9aQ5bak4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">但报告的态度是谨慎的。标题里那个“Maybe...”不是修辞，而是整份报告的核心立场。Datadog现在支撑着排名前十的所有AI实验室，<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>单一模型厂商的用量波动，未必等于整个市场的增量。如果OpenAI的上升只是从Anthropic那里获得的份额，那对Datadog来说，不过是篮子里的东西换了个位置。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVSfqmiazrlnMVqCaxxKvdXZGaK3pPQdAmLGB1C2B0rgBYzRVLZSuuKHPPTAnX1k68SdqZGqydYNVNRG6HL5nUcgB3aZQ3P9mko/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. OpenAI用量上升的同时，Anthropic出现走弱迹象</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX5lgDJIfz8OSTUpwoFdZvImFOPDljg8tLVYic6BbDdkBiaMic3OHKZZLkmCCiaYg1QgQnFtzQpNb7nItYGEO6QtP1tsU8sKzhjOLo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>在模型中已经纳入了对OpenAI约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>的季度环比增长预期，对Anthropic则只有约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span>。这个差距本身就说明，市场对两家实验室的近期动能已有分化判断。报告指出，Anthropic的用量信号本季度一直偏弱，最近还叠加了KIMI K3发布的影响。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVEEqA7b3EiaU63auIayZJeMfRWic5XjOWGtF5BLPvpol5OrPTOZsFEqth5ZgQwpb6OjXGzQzP1m9X0YibibTzT3uWxhb6kPKia4icjg/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 02-Bernstein-Datadog Inc-DDOG.US-Datadog -DDOG-- OpenAI-s price reduction a tailwind- Maybe...-260811</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
